    "detailed_description": "Calling All Animal Lovers!<br><br>For All Animal Lovers 8 and Up! Have tons of fun running your very own pet vet clinic. As doctor, you\u2019ll get to take care of fuzzy bunnies, adorable cats, dogs, horses, ponies, and even piglets. Enjoy awesome activities from check-ups to dog training and horseback riding. You\u2019ll learn amazing facts about animals while you treat, care for, and love them!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3 levels of challenging gameplay<br></li><li>Tons of animals including horses, ponies, dogs, cats, rabbits, and piglets<br></li><li>100+ animal ailments to diagnose and treat!<br></li><li>Earn a good reputation with pet owners and watch your business grow!<br></li><li>Play in freestyle or story mode<br></li><li>Great 3D graphics and animations<br></li><li>Examine! Investigate the symptoms and \ufb01nd out what\u2019s wrong.<br></li><li>Diagnose! What does your animal patient have?<br></li><li>Treat! It\u2019s up to you to get your patients on the road to recovery.<br></li><li>Go Shopping for foods, pet toys, vet supplies, and more!<br></li><li>Train! Work with your horses on their jumping skills.<br></li><li>Teach your dogs and pigs to sit, lie down, roll over, and fetch.<br></li><li>Go Riding! You can even bring the little foal along with you!</li></ul>",
